"hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2673,"** Narrated to us Ahmad ibn 'Abdah, who said: Hamam ibn Zayd informed us, from 'Abd al-'Aziz ibn Suhayb, from Anas ibn Malik (RA), who said: ""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) forbade men from using *taz'afur*."" Hamam said: ""He means *khuluq* (a type of perfume)."""
2674,"Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Mani' and Ziyad ibn Ayyub, both said: Narrated to us Isma'il ibn Ulayyah, who narrated to us 'Abd al-'Aziz ibn Suhayb. And also narrated to us 'Imran ibn Musa, who narrated to us 'Abd al-Wahhab, who narrated to us 'Abd al-'Aziz, from Anas ibn Malik (RA), who said:

""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) forbade a man from using *tazaffur* (a type of perfume with saffron).""

**CHAPTER:**"
